#   context is the embedded Dwg_OCD_Dimension, which the generic field search
#   does not see -- its 2 (the *D block by name) aborted the import;
# - RADIM/DMDIM OBJECTCONTEXTDATA out of DEBUG_CLASSES, stable like ALDIM
#   (classes.inc, objects.in/.c, dwg2.spec, dwg.h);
# - in_dxf.c: a pre-r2004 viewport is on or off in its VX_TABLE_RECORD, whose
#   is_on was never set (a commented-out line): every viewport saved as r2000
#   was off for ODA and AutoCAD. Now from the DXF 68 status.
# - in_dxf.c dxf_set_context_70: in a context object the 70 after the body's
#   subclass is a body field (MTEXT attachment, ...), not the class_version
